    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides physical birth, there is also a mental one. Sometimes, to carefreely keep playing games, you need to step into the world and solve your problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pain-Hatching</strong> is a game about the birth of personality, filled with the best game mechanics: exploring, backtracking, stat progression, and deck-building. Meet interesting characters and a meticulously crafted world, and play the game as if it's just a game. <strong>Pain-Hatching</strong> doesn\u2019t hide that.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides physical birth, there is also a mental one. Sometimes, to carefreely keep playing games, you need to step into the world and solve your problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pain-Hatching</strong> is a game about the birth of personality, filled with the best game mechanics: exploring, backtracking, stat progression, and deck-building. Meet interesting characters and a meticulously crafted world, and play the game as if it's just a game. <strong>Pain-Hatching</strong> doesn\u2019t hide that.</p>",
    "short_description": "Metroidvania, exploring, a deep story and characters, RPG elements, deck and stat-building. Imagine if Fur Fighters, American McGee\u2019s Alice, and Dark Souls merged into one game.",
